## Primary Objectives
- **Zero-Latency Perception:** Signals appear <50ms from backend to screen
- **Minimal Context Switching:** Users keep betting site visible at all times
- **Audio-First Alerts:** Eyes stay on betting interface, ears catch signals
- **Reliability:** Graceful handling of disconnections with auto-reconnection

