## Performance Optimization

### Frontend
- Code splitting by route
- Lazy load non-critical components
- Target: <100KB initial bundle
- Use React.memo for static components
- Virtualize long signal lists

### Backend
- Redis connection pooling
- Database query optimization
- WebSocket message batching
- Compress large payloads

### Rendering
- 60fps max for chart updates
- Skeleton screens during load
- Optimistic UI updates

## Error Handling

### Connection Issues
```tsx
{isDisconnected && (
    <Alert variant="warning">
        Reconnecting to server... Data may be delayed.
    </Alert>
)}
```

### Stale Data Detection
```typescript
if (Date.now() - lastUpdateTime > 10000) {
    setDataStale(true);
    showWarning("Live data feed interrupted");
}
```

### API Error Handling
```typescript
try {
    const result = await api.placeBet(betRequest);
    showSuccess("Bet placed successfully");
} catch (error) {
    if (error.status === 400) {
        showError("Insufficient funds");
    } else if (error.status === 500) {
        showError("Server error. Please try again.");
    }
}
```

