## Security Considerations
- Validate all WebSocket messages against schema
- Rate limit user actions (max 10 API calls/sec)
- Sanitize user inputs
- Use environment variables for sensitive config
- Enable AUTH_ENABLED for production

## Development Workflow
1. Start backend: `python -m backend.main`
2. Start frontend: `npm run dev` in frontend/
3. Both connect to Redis for real-time updates
4. Use `start.ps1` to launch full stack

